    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the rear pressure bulkhead, identifying the six outer radial segments, the segment root shear ties, the outboard brackets and the circumferential joint hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the rear pressure bulkhead web segments, the radial stiffener attachments, the outboard brackets and the circumferential joint parts, viewed from the forward face.",
      "figure_note": "The bulkhead is shown from the forward face with the segment numbering running clockwise from the top centre. Only the outer radial segments are itemised; the inner segments are covered by a separate figure. The lug at item 60 is a superseded item and is shown for identification only on aircraft that have not had it renewed. Shim packs are not itemised because they are made to fit at installation and are recorded on the aircraft build sheet."
    },
